# AGENT CAPSULE

Bash hooks + Obsidian. One model per conversation.
Read `HANDOFF.md` for multi-session work. Prefer NO CODE. Smallest Diff.
Start: hot then index. Stop with tools: Session + hot + HANDOFF.
Git only when asked. Secrets never in code or chat.
Done = `docs/TOOLCHAIN.md` green with evidence.
Never fight a deny. Never reintroduce Rust kleos-gate or pack Python.

# AUTONOMOUS LOOP (NO EARLY STOPS)

Work ends when every Done-when predicate holds — not after the first draft.
INTENT is a job card: OBJECTIVE = postcondition on named units (tagged paths); Done-when = decidable proofs.

1. NO ASK INSIDE INTENT: if something is missing for Done-when, do it now. Do not ask permission.
2. NO PARTIAL HANDOFFS: ban closers like "let me know if…", "want me to…", "I can add…", "déjame saber / quieres que". If needed for INTENT, write it in this turn.
3. GROUND → TAG → EDIT: Glob/Grep/Read until OBJECTIVE paths/symbols are in context; tag `edit:path` or `NEW:path`; StrReplace existing; Write only NEW; never invent parallel trees.
4. PRE-STOP SELF-CHECK: re-Read tagged FILES; re-prove every Done-when predicate on disk/TOOLCHAIN. First draft ≠ met.
5. CASCADE FIX: broken import/test from your change → fix same turn. Do not leave red.
6. CLOSE SIGNAL: when Done-when is met, write `Done-when: met` then stop. `stop_gate` audits markers and will force another pass if you stop early.
